<\\/tr>\",\"data\":[[\"GLENVIEW GOLF CLUB - 2413175\"],[2],[6328484],[0],[0],[\"2024\"],[\"10074001230000\"],[\"GLENVIEW GOLF CLUB\"],[0],[2],[\"\"]],\"container\":\"<table class=\\\"display\\\">\\n  <thead>\\n    <tr>\\n      <th>Project (Appellant / Key PIN)<\\/th>\\n      <th>PINs<\\/th>\\n      <th>FMV (2024)<\\/th>\\n      <th>Incentive PINs (2024)<\\/th>\\n      <th>PINs in a TIF (2024)<\\/th>\\n      <th>Last Year of Paid Taxbill<\\/th>\\n      <th>Key PIN<\\/th>\\n      <th>Exempt PINs (2024)<\\/th>\\n      <th>Observed PINs (2024)<\\/th>\\n      <th>Recorded buyer and purchase year<\\/th>\\n      <th>Appellant and appeal tax year<\\/th>\\n    <\\/tr>\\n  <\\/thead>\\n<\\/table>\",\"options\":{\"pageLength\":10,\"scrollX\":true,\"autoWidth\":true,\"columnDefs\":[{\"targets\":2,\"render\":\"function(data, type, row, meta) {\\n    return type !== 'display' ? data : DTWidget.formatCurrency(data, \\\"$\\\", 0, 3, \\\",\\\", \\\".\\\", true, null);\\n  }\"},{\"className\":\"dt-right\",\"targets\":[1,2,3,4,8,9]},{\"name\":\"project_identifier\",\"targets\":0},{\"name\":\"pins_in_region\",\"targets\":1},{\"name\":\"fmv_2024\",\"targets\":2},{\"name\":\"incentive_class_pins_2024\",\"targets\":3},{\"name\":\"tif_pins_2024\",\"targets\":4},{\"name\":\"last_positive_bill_years\",\"targets\":5},{\"name\":\"keypin\",\"targets\":6},{\"name\":\"appellant\",\"targets\":7},{\"name\":\"exempt_2024\",\"targets\":8},{\"name\":\"observed_2024\",\"targets\":9},{\"name\":\"buyer\",\"targets\":10}],\"order\":[],\"orderClasses\":false,\"orderCellsTop\":true}},\"evals\":[\"options.columnDefs.0.render\"],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Sources and coverage\n\nHistorical universe: `commercial_industrial_pin_universe_2026_09_21.csv`, derived from `comm_ind_PINs_ever_2006to2024.csv`. Classification and FMV: 2024 observations in that underlying extract. Project assignments: `project_assignments_phase7_2026_09_22.csv` (phase-7 key PIN). Appellants and appeal years: latest tax-year records for each PIN in `borappeals_UPDATED.csv`, including all ties. Names come only from BOR records for that PIN, with no fallback to reviewed names. Buyer names come from the assignment file; purchase years are matched by PIN, sale document, and buyer in Assessor_Parcel_Sales_20250105.csv. Unmatched years are shown as unavailable. Last positive bills use the 2006-2024 history, and TIF membership uses tif_record_present in the 2024 extract. Class descriptions: `class_dict_expanded.csv`. Geometry: 2024 footprints from `ptaxsim-2024.0.0.db`.\n\nPIN totals come from the tabular universe, independently of map coverage. Footprints are drawn once even when multiple PINs share the same ten-digit identifier. Assignment-review counts identify flagged records; absence of a flag does not certify an assignment. Directory and PIN-search pages may still use older data vintages.\n",
